<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE 76-2 AT LUNCH AGAINST GRIQUAS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE 76-2 AT LUNCH AGAINST GRIQUAS.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State were 76 for two in their first innings at lunch on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match against Griqualand West at Kimberley Country Club on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Free State 76-2 in 29 overs.</p>
